WEBVTT

00:05:28.863 --> 00:05:31.347
They come from dignified employment,

00:05:31.371 --> 00:05:33.156
at decent pay.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.938
The kind of employment
that enables us to say,

00:05:36.962 --> 00:05:38.962
"I helped to build this country.

00:05:39.522 --> 00:05:43.500
I am a participant
in its great public ventures."

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.522
This civic sentiment

00:05:47.546 --> 00:05:51.625
is largely missing
from our public life today.

00:05:52.788 --> 00:05:56.565
We often assume that the money people make

00:05:56.589 --> 00:05:59.878
is the measure of their contribution
to the common good.